  "summary": "Lying face down, the arms reach forward, then sweep wide to the hips as the chest lifts — a swimmer's stroke for the upper back.",
  "steps": [
    "Lie face down, legs long and together, arms by the sides.",
    "Breathe out to reach the arms forward and lift the chest a little.",
    "Breathe in to circle the arms wide and back to the hips, palms in.",
    "Breathe out to lower."
